{
    "title": "BettingPros: Sports Betting",
    "description": "Make winning bets with advice and picks from top sports betting experts.\r\n\r\nThe BettingPros app puts consensus and expert-driven sports betting advice at your fingertips to help you pinpoint the best odds and make winning bets.\r\n\r\n<b>ODDS & LINES</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 Find the best betting odds for point spreads, totals, moneyline, and futures across the NFL, NBA, MLB, NCAA, NHL, Soccer, Golf, UFC and more.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Target the best odds and lines aggregated from all of the top sportsbooks, including FanDuel Sportsbook, DraftKings Sportsbook, and BetMGM.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Tail the sharps! Easily see when a side is getting a higher percentage of money compared to the percentage of bets.\r\n\r\n<b>PROP BET PICKS</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 Find the best props with the Prop Bet Analyzer, including custom analysis, research, and recommendations.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Use the Prop Bet Cheat Sheet for daily rankings of the best prop bets based on our accurate projection models.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Sort by Over % and Under % to find the right balance between value and trend.\r\n\r\n<b>PICKS & BET TRACKING</b> *\r\n\r\n\u2022 Find winning bets with consensus picks from accurate experts and the BettingPros community. Over 150 of the top football betting experts were tracked during the NFL season.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Sync and track your bets, and monitor performance with our pick reporting tools and charts. Filter and track by sport, game picks, props, parlays, and more. *\r\n\r\n\u2022 Browse community SGPs or build your own winning combinations.\r\n\r\n<b>COMMUNITY & BETTING GROUPS</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 Discover top bettors to follow and then check your Following Feed to find the golden needles in the haystack.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Create and join groups, tail bets in the feed, browse members, and follow top bettors in the leaderboards.\r\n\r\n<b>TOP-RATED BETS</b>\r\n(Premium subscription required)\r\n\r\n\u2022 View Advanced Bet Metrics for Cover Probability and Expected Values.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Get 1 to 5 star rated picks for Spread, Totals and Prop Bets.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Support for NFL, NCAAF, MLB props, NBA props, and NHL props.\r\n\r\n<b>NOTIFICATIONS & ALERTS</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022  Custom Line Alerts: Get instant notifications for custom line movement targets that you set.\r\n\r\n\u2022  Bet Notifications: Get bet notifications from people you follow customized by sport.\r\n\r\n<b>GAMES & SCORES</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 Research team stats, follow player injuries, and analyze trends to help you make smarter bets before a game.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Follow games and picks with live scores and plays. Once a game is over, easily see totals and line covers for NFL, College Football (NCAAF), College Basketball (NCAAB), NBA, MLB, NHL, Soccer, and more.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Browse and search player stats and prop bet lines and track their progress live during the game.\r\n\r\n<b>GUIDES & ANALYSIS</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 Learn simple and advanced sports betting tips with our comprehensive Sports Betting Guide for beginners and sharps alike.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Read daily articles and analysis, ranging from recommended picks to tips on how to become a more profitable sports bettor, across a multitude of sports: NFL, NCAAF, NBA, MLB, NCAAB, Soccer, Golf, Tennis, UFC, Boxing, Horse Racing, and more. Now with Premium content for exclusive prop and game picks.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Catch up on the latest player news, injuries, and line movements with expert Betting Impact summaries.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Listen to episodes of the BettingPros Podcast and The Sharps Report, or get quick sports betting picks every day, all year round on The Daily Juice.\r\n\r\n----------\r\n\r\nBettingPros is a sports betting advice network created by FantasyPros, the #1 source for fantasy sports advice. Be sure to also visit us on web and social media for more sports betting and fantasy advice.\r\n\r\n<b>Important Notice</b>\r\n\r\n* BettingPros content is intended for entertainment purposes only and does not include real money gambling. Picks added in the app do not include real money wagers, payouts or prizes. Please be aware of and respect the laws regarding sports betting for your jurisdiction.\r\n\r\nBettingPros is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google, the NFL, MLB, NBA, NHL, PGA, or NCAA.\r\n\r\nIf you or someone you know has a gambling problem and wants help, call 1-800-GAMBLER.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Make winning bets with advice and picks from top sports betting experts.<br><br>The BettingPros app puts consensus and expert-driven sports betting advice at your fingertips to help you pinpoint the best odds and make winning bets.<br><br><b>ODDS &amp; LINES</b><br><br>\u2022 Find the best betting odds for point spreads, totals, moneyline, and futures across the NFL, NBA, MLB, NCAA, NHL, Soccer, Golf, UFC and more.<br><br>\u2022 Target the best odds and lines aggregated from all of the top sportsbooks, including FanDuel Sportsbook, DraftKings Sportsbook, and BetMGM.<br><br>\u2022 Tail the sharps! Easily see when a side is getting a higher percentage of money compared to the percentage of bets.<br><br><b>PROP BET PICKS</b><br><br>\u2022 Find the best props with the Prop Bet Analyzer, including custom analysis, research, and recommendations.<br><br>\u2022 Use the Prop Bet Cheat Sheet for daily rankings of the best prop bets based on our accurate projection models.<br><br>\u2022 Sort by Over % and Under % to find the right balance between value and trend.<br><br><b>PICKS &amp; BET TRACKING</b> *<br><br>\u2022 Find winning bets with consensus picks from accurate experts and the BettingPros community. Over 150 of the top football betting experts were tracked during the NFL season.<br><br>\u2022 Sync and track your bets, and monitor performance with our pick reporting tools and charts. Filter and track by sport, game picks, props, parlays, and more. *<br><br>\u2022 Browse community SGPs or build your own winning combinations.<br><br><b>COMMUNITY &amp; BETTING GROUPS</b><br><br>\u2022 Discover top bettors to follow and then check your Following Feed to find the golden needles in the haystack.<br><br>\u2022 Create and join groups, tail bets in the feed, browse members, and follow top bettors in the leaderboards.<br><br><b>TOP-RATED BETS</b><br>(Premium subscription required)<br><br>\u2022 View Advanced Bet Metrics for Cover Probability and Expected V