not include real money gambling. Picks added in the app do not include real money wagers, payouts or prizes. Please be aware of and respect the laws regarding sports betting for your jurisdiction.<br><br>BettingPros is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google, the NFL, MLB, NBA, NHL, PGA, or NCAA.<br><br>If you or someone you know has a gambling problem and wants help, call 1-800-GAMBLER.",
